       "text": "$(\\overline{A} + \\overline{B} + C)$ expands as $(\\overline{A} + \\overline{B} + C + D)(\\overline{A} + \\overline{B} + C + \\overline{D}) \\implies 1100_2 (12) \\text{ and } 1101_2 (13) \\implies \\mathbf{M_{12} \\cdot M_{13}}$."
